OL,3,ASecurity flaw found in Java, world's
OL,4,Athird-largest programming language
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyber-security firm has used
OL,7,Fartificial intelligence (AI) to uncover
OL,8,Fa major flaw in the hugely popular
OL,9,Fcomputer language program Java.
OL,11,FTech start-up Calif - which recently
OL,12,Fidentified a cyber-security flaw in
OL,13,Fanother programming language, PHP -
OL,14,Ffound the bug in Java's memory
OL,15,Ffunctions.
OL,17,FJava is the world's third largest
OL,18,Fprogramming language used by 90% of the
OL,19,Fworld's Fortune 500 companies like
OL,20,FApple and Amazon, and many banks,
OL,21,Fhospitals and governments.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
